            "line": 1053,
            "text": "theorem covariance_increment_exact (u v : Oscillation D)\n    (hu : AngularContinuous u) (hv : AngularContinuous v) :\n    bilinearCovariance (u + v) (u + v) - bilinearCovariance u u =\n      bilinearCovariance u v + bilinearCovariance v u + bilinearCovariance v v"
